{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日SOL！今週、SOL！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はね！橋本奈々未ガールズ教室が始まってから初の！\n◯◯◯◯しながらの授業！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、ここでみんなにクイズ！\n◯に入る言葉はなーんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えは明日のブログねヾ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それまでに放送を聴いて、それぞれ答えをコメントに書き込むこと！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生徒のみんな、いいですかーー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0000-6.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴かないとこの髪色明るいヤンキーみたいなお姉さんが怒るよ！ぷんぷん！やかん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうちゃんと髪染めて暗めの色だけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怒ったらこんな顔になるぞ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanami.hashimoto/img/0001-6.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（今はなきまゆこの指に何故か異常に怒ってる顔）（ほんとは怒ってないよ）（怒ったフリだからね）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は第３週！22時からSOL！全国で聴けるよ！聴いてねん！ヾ(｡･ω･｡)"}],"source":"archive"}